&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Network Automation Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you will design, develop, and implement automation solutions to improve network efficiency, scalability, and reliability. This role is a blend of deep networking expertise and software development, aimed at streamlining network operations and reducing manual intervention.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Frameworks:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement network automation frameworks and solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scripting &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop automation scripts using &lt;strong&gt;Python, Ansible, Terraform&lt;/strong&gt;, Pulumi, or similar tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provisioning &amp;amp; Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; Automate network provisioning, configuration, and deployment processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Monitoring &amp;amp; Remediation:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor network performance and build automated alerting and remediation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect deployment pipelines using GitHub Actions, managing both GitHub-hosted and self-hosted runners for specialized build requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with APIs, SDKs, and SDN controllers to integrate automation into the broader infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Network, DevOps, and Security teams to ensure seamless workflows and compliance with security policies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Troubleshoot automation failures, optimize existing workflows, and maintain high standards for documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of relevant experience as a Network Engineer&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Networking Fundamentals:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of TCP/IP, DNS, and DHCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in Switching, VLANs, WAN/LAN, and SD-WAN/VPN.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with routers, switches, and firewalls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Programming:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
