&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IaC Tools:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with Ansible, Terraform, or Pulumi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with REST APIs, JSON/YAML, Git, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern Infrastructure:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud networking experience (AWS, Azure, or GCP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SDN/NFV concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of container networking (Docker/Kubernetes) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
