&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an engineering manager for our Warehouse Scale team. In this role, you&#39;ll lead the team that builds and operates the foundational data infrastructure powering LaunchDarkly&#39;s warehouse-native products — data export pipelines, warehouse health checks, and warehouse connection setup.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll bring a balance of people management and technical leadership as you drive the development of critical platform infrastructure and foster a high-performing, collaborative engineering culture. You&#39;ll partner closely with Product Management and cross-functional teams to deliver reliable, scalable systems that enterprise customers depend on.&lt;/p&gt;
