&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7088&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fabacc5edd23&quot;&gt;Configure, deploy, maintain, and troubleshoot laptops, peripherals, meeting room technology, mobile device workflows, and standard employee productivity tools.&lt;/p&gt;
