&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;7251&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b94564c6dde3&quot;&gt;Create, maintain, and improve internal documentation, knowledge base articles, troubleshooting guides, and repeatable operating procedures so employees and teammates can resolve common issues more efficiently.&lt;/p&gt;
