&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior App Engineer focused on AI and Automation, you will lead the design and delivery of AI-powered systems that improve productivity across LaunchDarkly. You will work closely with the CIO and cross-functional partners to identify opportunities, define architecture for internal AI workflows, and bring solutions into production at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7606c0e341de&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4846&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d5ff9feeba2a&quot;&gt;Lead end-to-end delivery of AI-powered agents and automation systems, from problem definition through production deployment and continuous improvement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5000&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5496c55cdc9f&quot;&gt;Design architectures for AI workflows that span multiple systems, tools, and data sources&lt;br&gt;Partner with the CIO to evaluate opportunities and provide input on internal AI strategy and priorities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5197&quot; data-local-id=&quot;cc6ee2ff7715&quot;&gt;Make and document build vs buy decisions, including participating in vendor evaluation and selection processes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5311&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e676a0051eb&quot;&gt;Establish and apply production standards, including reliability, observability, and safe handling of data&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5420&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5e3e6b82b4c5&quot;&gt;Define how success is measured and ensure systems deliver measurable improvements in productivity, speed, or cost&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5537&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d09763ba3490&quot;&gt;Reuse and extend internal AI platform capabilities such as shared services, skills, and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_kqswh2mm&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_5pioz8co _189e1dm9 _1il9buyh _19lc184f _d0altlke&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;MCP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; servers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5640&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d2fc3325cd77&quot;&gt;Mentor AI engineers by reviewing work, guiding design decisions, and helping structure projects&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5739&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bca4e11e9d7b&quot;&gt;Collaborate with global teams, including US-based stakeholders, to align on priorities and deliver solutions across time zones&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ea652aca-9322-4e16-8ca8-367189229330&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6024&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20637d66ca1e&quot;&gt;Strong experience building applications or systems using Python or similar languages&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6112&quot; data-local-id=&quot;2184b7c6720f&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience designing and implementing AI-powered workflows or agents in real-world use cases&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6217&quot; data-local-id=&quot;499747118c35&quot;&gt;Strong data background, including working with databases, data modeling, or analytics workflows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6316&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e1ecaa9b7586&quot;&gt;Experience integrating and scaling solutions across multiple systems, APIs, or platforms&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6408&quot; data-local-id=&quot;649a85a5e72c&quot;&gt;Experience using and extending no-code or low-code automation and AI tools such as Workato, Glean, or similar&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;6521&quot; data-local-id=&quot;952b266184bf&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead projects end-to-end, including scoping, architecture, implementation, and productionization&lt;/p&gt;
