&lt;li&gt;Strong operational background including new process launch, service delivery in a high growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with written and verbal communications for both technical and non-technical audiences at the senior leadership level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in obtaining, organizing, and analyzing data to challenge conventional wisdom, make fact-based decisions, and drive root cause analysis, and evaluate outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
